{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Medium Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"Hi! My name is Mika! Since I'm a long stay pup, my adoption fee has been reduced! Apply for me today to find out my favorite treats and how you can take me home! Here's what my friends at ACC say about me:\n\nMeet Mika!\n\nMika arrived at ACC as a stray and is now enjoying life in a foster home! This sweet girl is described as playful and affectionate once she gets to know you.\n\nMy Ideal Home\n\nMika thrives in a calm and consistent environment. She can feel unsure in new situations and does best with a patient approach. Her foster parent is working on muzzle acclimation to help her manage triggers on walks, which her new family can continue.\n\nThings to Know\n\nMika is generally healthy. She can get excited in her kennel and benefits from calm routines. She is still building her leash manners and can get worked up around other dogs and people on leash, so continued training in this area will be beneficial. She has shown some sensitivity around her rear legs during exams. Mika is currently not on any medications.\n\nFun Fact\n\nMika loves plush toys and will often carry one with her on walks! 🧸","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=10&searchType=4&animalid=142268","id":"018909324764e63db6771c5f6982bc6e","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/23228de8e34d49d0860eea7330ada1b9-1685636358-1790711343-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/bc5a912a87e8428f8fc5a1611aa5dc2e-1685636357-1706719262-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/964c728484124c8bb98406e6a19bff62-1690222217-1690222217-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/ca9fc015bb0f4f26a3b7dbbde8e6